    <!-- Onboarding -->
    <string name="ob1_title">The realm is lost in mist</string>
    <string name="ob1_text">Wherever you walk, the mist parts for good. Week by week, road by road, your city becomes an atlas of your own.</string>
    <string name="ob2_title">The mist hides wonders</string>
    <string name="ob2_caches">Treasure chests</string>
    <string name="ob2_caches_text">Hidden all across the realm and refilled every Monday. Walk up to one to open it.</string>
    <string name="ob2_beacon">Shrines of the day</string>
    <string name="ob2_beacon_text">Each day three shrines awaken where the mist is thickest: golden, grove and azure. Reach any one of them for the day\'s richest reward.</string>
    <string name="ob2_relics">Relics and deeds</string>
    <string name="ob2_relics_text">Sixty relics in ten sets, from a brass compass to a dragon\'s scale, four of them only in their season; relic stars, arms of the lands and over two hundred deeds.</string>
    <string name="ob2_streak">Quests and streaks</string>
    <string name="ob2_streak_text">New quests every dawn, a great quest every week, and a streak that grows with every day on the road.</string>
    <string name="ob3_title">Where does your journey begin?</string>
    <string name="ob3_text">Fogwalk needs your location to part the mist. Nothing leaves this phone: no account, no server, no ads.</string>
    <string name="ob4_title">Count your steps?</string>
    <string name="ob4_text">Fogwalk can count your steps on walks with the phone\'s own sensor: they show on the map and in the history of journeys. You can change this in the settings at any time.</string>
    <string name="ob4_yes">Count my steps</string>
    <string name="ob4_no">No, thanks</string>

